OL,3,GNEWSAAsian hornet nest found in
OL,4,ASomerset for first time
OL,5,
OL,6,FA nest of yellow-legged Asian hornets
OL,7,Fhas been discovered in Somerset for the
OL,8,Ffirst time, the government has said.
OL,10,FThe predatory insects, as their name
OL,11,Fsuggests, are native to Asia, but have
OL,12,Fbeen growing in numbers across Europe
OL,13,Fsince the 2000s and have become a
OL,14,Fproblem in the Channel Islands.
OL,16,FA beekeeper in Ashcott, near Street,
OL,17,Fdiscovered one of the hornets near his
OL,18,Fbeehives, and the main nest was found
OL,19,Fin nearby woodland and destroyed on
OL,20,FWednesday.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
