OL,3,GNEWSAAsian hornet nest found in
OL,4,ASomerset for first time
OL,5,
OL,6,FLynne Ingram, a master beekeeper and
OL,7,Fthe head of the Asian Hornet Action
OL,8,FTeam in Somerset, said the species is
OL,9,Fvery invasive so needs reporting and
OL,10,Fdestroying as soon as any are
OL,11,Fdiscovered.
